अप्रच्युत a. Unmoved, not
swerving from, following, observing
(with abl.);

अप्रजस्, अप्रजात a. Childless,
having no issue or progeny;
अतीतायामप्रजसि बांधवास्तदवाप्नुयुः

अप्रजस्, अप्रजात a. Childless,
having no issue or progeny;
अतीतायामप्रजसि बांधवास्तदवाप्नुयुः

अप्रमत्त a. Not careless or
inattentive, careful, attentive,
vigilant, watchful;

] Not going or progressing
(used only in uttering imprecations);
अप्रयाणिस्ते शठ भूयात् Sk. mayest
thou not move onward or progress!
See अजीवनि.
